{
  "_comment": [
    "Shared cases for the two column rules the dashboard had to copy from the TUI (#550):",
    "the CTX percentage and the permission-mode label (internal/tui/mode.go).",
    "Since ADR-0011 (#616) the CTX cases prove a chain rather than two twins:",
    "the daemon derives `pct` from `model` + `tokens` (internal/server/sessions.go),",
    "and each client renders `want` from `pct` — internal/tui/column_shared_test.go",
    "and test/js/dashboard.test.mjs, which must agree case for case.",
    "The note that used to live here, on Go rounding half to even where Math.round",
    "rounds half up, is gone with the second rounding: there is one now."
  ],
  "context": [
    {
      "why": "no reading at all is a dash, not a zero",
      "model": "claude-opus-4-8",
      "tokens": null,
      "pct": null,
      "want": "-"
    },
    {
      "why": "a reading that happens to be zero is 0%, and #367 exists to keep these apart",
      "model": "claude-opus-4-8",
      "tokens": 0,
      "pct": 0,
      "want": "0%"
    },
    {
      "why": "opus 4.8 has the million-token window",
      "model": "claude-opus-4-8",
      "tokens": 100000,
      "pct": 10,
      "want": "10%"
    },
    {
      "why": "opus 4.5 does not",
      "model": "claude-opus-4-5",
      "tokens": 100000,
      "pct": 50,
      "want": "50%"
    },
    {
      "why": "the boundary is 4.6",
      "model": "claude-opus-4-6",
      "tokens": 100000,
      "pct": 10,
      "want": "10%"
    },
    {
      "why": "sonnet follows the same rule",
      "model": "claude-sonnet-5",
      "tokens": 100000,
      "pct": 10,
      "want": "10%"
    },
    {
      "why": "fable is always big",
      "model": "claude-fable-5",
      "tokens": 250000,
      "pct": 25,
      "want": "25%"
    },
    {
      "why": "haiku is always base",
      "model": "claude-haiku-4-5",
      "tokens": 20000,
      "pct": 10,
      "want": "10%"
    },
    {
      "why": "an unknown family falls back to base",
      "model": "claude-mystery-9",
      "tokens": 20000,
      "pct": 10,
      "want": "10%"
    },
    {
      "why": "no model at all falls back to base",
      "model": "",
      "tokens": 20000,
      "pct": 10,
      "want": "10%"
    },
    {
      "why": "a non-numeric version part is zero, not a parsed prefix — strconv.Atoi rejects it",
      "model": "claude-opus-4x-9",
      "tokens": 20000,
      "pct": 10,
      "want": "10%"
    },
    {
      "why": "a negative reading clamps to zero rather than rendering a negative fill",
      "model": "claude-opus-4-8",
      "tokens": -5,
      "pct": 0,
      "want": "0%"
    },
    {
      "why": "a full window",
      "model": "claude-opus-4-5",
      "tokens": 200000,
      "pct": 100,
      "want": "100%"
    }
  ],
